      "prompt": "A student is solving $E_1:x+y+z={{c1}}$, $E_2:2x-y+z={{c2}}$, $E_3:x+2y-z={{c3}}$ by Gaussian elimination. Analyze the row-operation error, repair it, and finish the complete 3×3 solve.",
